          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 147950,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quel est le nombre maximum de valeurs qu'un tableau peut contenir dans un jeu (comme des ennemis sur un niveau) ?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Autant que nous voulons</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">10</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Autant que nous voulons.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 147951,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qu'est-ce qu'un élément ?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Une valeur dans un tableau</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un tableau</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">La condition d'un tableau</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Une valeur dans un tableau.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 147952,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assigne un tableau avec la valeur <code>\"Collect 10 coins\"</code> à la variable <code>questLog</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Defeat the dragon&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" questLog = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Collect 10 coins&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Quest Log:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(questLog);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>[</code> suivi de <code>\"Collect 10 coins\"</code> et enfin <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 147953,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crée un tableau stockant <code>\"forest\"</code> et <code>\"dungeon\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levels = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;forest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dungeon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levels);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>[</code> suivi de <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 147954,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Que montre ce code dans la console ?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[ \"\" ]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[ inventory ]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>[]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 147955,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quel est l'index de <code>\"slime\"</code> ?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>-1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 147956,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mets à jour le deuxième élément en <code>\"Mage\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"party[2]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Paladin&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"53\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" party = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Rogue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"party[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(party);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>party[1]</code> suivi de <code>=</code> et enfin <code>\"Mage\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 147957,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quel est le dernier index auquel nous pouvons accéder dans ce tableau ?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" checkpointsReached = [\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 147958,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code <code>\"Meg\"</code> à l'index <code>0</code> et <code>\"Max\"</code> à l'index <code>1</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Meg&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Max&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(players);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>\"Meg\"</code> suivi de <code>\"Max\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 147959,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Comment accédons-nous à la valeur <code>22</code> dans ce tableau ?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scoreMilestones = [\" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>scoreMilestones[2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>scoreMilestones[3]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>scoreMilestones(2)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>scoreMilestones[2]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 147960,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Que fait <code>.pop()</code> ?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il supprime la dernière valeur d'un tableau</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il supprime la première valeur d'un tableau</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Il supprime une valeur aléatoire d'un tableau</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il supprime la dernière valeur d'un tableau.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 147961,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Que fait <code>.push()</code> ?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il ajoute une valeur à un tableau</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il supprime une valeur d'un tableau</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Il crée un tableau</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il ajoute une valeur à un tableau.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 147962,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ajoute <code>\"Health Potion\"</code> à ce tableau d'inventaire.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Mana Potion&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"76\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Wooden Sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"inventory.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Health Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>inventory</code> suivi de <code>.</code> puis <code>push</code>, <code>\"Health Potion\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 147963,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quel est l'index de <code>\"Fire Rune\"</code> dans le tableau, après l'avoir ajouté avec <code>push()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" runes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ice Rune&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"runes.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Fire Rune&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(runes);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 147964,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quelle est la valeur de <code>lastLife</code> ?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" extraLives = [\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lastLife = extraLives.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(lastLife);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 147965,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Combien d'éléments un tableau vide contient-il ?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 147966,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qu'est-ce que cet extrait de code va afficher dans la console ?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bosses = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime King&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Goblin Chief&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Stone Golem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Shadow Knight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"bosses.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"bosses.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(bosses.length);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"6\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #18",
            "id": 147967,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qu'est-ce que cet extrait de code va afficher dans la console ?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lootBag = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lootBag.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lootBag.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;map&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(lootBag);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[\"coin\", \"gem\", \"key\", \"potion\", \"map\"]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"coin\", \"gem\", \"key\", \"potion\"]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">5</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[\"coin\", \"gem\", \"key\", \"potion\", \"map\"]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
